  publish: []
---
Choose the single most appropriate Jira issue type for this alert. Return JSON only: {"issue_type_id": "...", "reason": "..."}. issue_type_id must be copied exactly from the catalogue.

Catalogue: {{catalogue_json}}
Alert summary: {{summary}}
Alert details: {{description}}{{operational_context_block}}
